The client of the Xiaomi TV local API (src/mitv/) was written for this
project. Xiaomi does not document this API: the community documentation of
pymitv (https://github.com/simse/pymitv, MIT, used by the Home Assistant
"Xiaomi TV" integration) and mireco (https://github.com/spocky/mireco) served
as the reference for the requests; no code was copied from them.

Xiaomi, Mi and PatchWall are trademarks of their respective owners. This
project is not affiliated with, endorsed or supported by them. It talks to the
TVs with the same local requests as the Mi Remote app, which a firmware update
may change without notice.
